{"pageProps":{"page":{"ID":1798,"post_author":"9","post_date":"August 11, 2025","post_date_gmt":"2025-08-11 21:27:54","post_title":"July 2025 Product Release","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","post_name":"july-2025-product-release","post_modified":"2025-08-13 16:58:51","post_modified_gmt":"2025-08-13 16:58:51","guid":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/?p=1798","post_type":"post","filter":"raw","url":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/resources/july-2025-product-release/","preview_type":"image","content_blocks":[{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This month’s updates bring transparency and automation to order outs, faster workflows with centralized contacts management, and streamlined document management. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each upgrade is built to save time, reduce manual work, and ensure loans move with clarity.</span></p>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Order outs visibility for appraisal and title</h2>\n<p>Tracking appraisal and title order outs is now fully transparent and automated, available via API and Command Center, with a new summary table on the Product &amp; Pricing tab and an activity log that captures the full lifecycle of each order out, updated programmatically.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Real-time transparency</strong> into appraisal and title order outs</li>\n<li><strong>Easy access</strong> to statuses, contacts, and related documents</li>\n<li><strong>Full lifecycle tracking</strong> with automated updates</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blog-Post-Img-Order-outs-1.png","alt":"Blog Post Img Order outs","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Contacts management for faster loan workflows</h2>\n<p>You can now add, edit, remove, and view loan contacts directly on each file via API and in the Command Center. A built-in contact book makes it easy to reuse contacts across loans. Search and filter tools make it simple to manage large contact lists, and contacts now automatically flow into disclosures.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Centralized contact management</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Streamlined workflows</strong> with reusable, auto-populating contact data</li>\n<li><strong>Easy search and filtering</strong> for large contact lists</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blog-Post-Img-Contacts-management.png","alt":"Blog Post Img Contacts management","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Streamlined documents management</h2>\n<p>Loan files now include a Documents tab (Command Center and via API) that shows all system- and borrower-uploaded documents in one place. Loan officers can search and filter across documents, making it faster and easier to find exactly what they need at any stage of the loan.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>One place</strong> to view all loan documents</li>\n<li><strong>Faster access</strong> with search and filtering tools</li>\n<li><strong>Greater efficiency</strong> throughout the loan lifecycle</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blog-Post-Img-Documents-management.png","alt":"Blog Post Img Documents management","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>API improvements</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’ve continued to enhance Pylon’s API to give originators more visibility, flexibility, and control across the loan lifecycle.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can now track borrower engagement with disclosures through a new “Viewed On” field, complementing the existing “Sent” status and providing a clearer timeline.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’ve also introduced API-based documents and contacts management, centralizing file handling and reducing manual work. Appraisal documents are now accessible directly from the appraisal object in API, making it faster to retrieve and share the files you need.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lastly, you can now select from multiple rate lock durations and request pricing for specific lock terms directly via API, giving you more control over the lock process. </span></p>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>More news from Pylon</h2>\n<p>» <a href=\"https://www.pylonlending.com/resources/bringing-the-future-of-mortgage-to-market-at-pylon/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bringing the Future of Mortgage to Market at Pylon</span></a></p>\n"}],"related_heading":"Keep reading","related_button_label":"Read more","categories":[{"id":16,"name":"Releases","slug":"release-notes"}],"author":{"name":"Brett Byron","acf":{"profile_image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Brett.png","alt":"Brett","width":515,"height":417}}},"seo":{"title":"July 2025 Product Release - Pylon","description":"Pylon’s latest updates bring transparency to order outs and streamline workflows with contacts and document management","image":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blog-Post-Hero-July-Product-Release-1024x623.png"},"featured_image":{"src":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Blog-Post-Hero-July-Product-Release.png","width":760,"height":460,"alt":"Blog Post Hero July Product Release"}},"options":{"menu":{"nav_items":[{"link":{"title":"Platform","url":"/#","target":""},"has_submenu":true,"submenu_type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"grid","grid_links":[{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_lay